	(text "Power input (decision 0003 6, 7.3): J7 1 = +24 V, 2 = 0 V. PTC F1 (4A hold, part number not confirmed) -> series P-channel MOSFET Q1 (drain on the supply side: a reversed supply keeps it off) with gate zener DZ1 12 V + RG1 -> TVS1 33 V and CB1 100 uF/35 V. The board +24V is taken only from here; no power on the signal connectors."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 453.42 0)
