	(text "a2 digit: AIN = A2B, ZIN = Z2B (common board). a1 digit: AIN = A1B, ZIN = Z1B.\nPreset (HOME): clock lines both 0 V clears the digits, LOAD = 24 V feeds the dial; PA*_b lines load the slave relays.\nBuffers: the common a3/a4 code lines (T*, L*) drive 10 local relays whose contacts feed this unit's CTRL lines."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
